flowchart TB
    Users[Customer / merchant tasks] --> Services[Android, web, API, workers, providers]
    Services --> Signals[Privacy-safe logs, metrics, traces, crash + domain outcomes]
    Services --> Audit[Separate controlled audit evidence]
    Signals --> SLI[SLIs + capacity + cost + telemetry health]
    SLI --> Budget[SLO and error-budget evaluation]
    Budget --> Alert{Action needed?}
    Alert -- Yes --> Incident[Owned alert + runbook + incident]
    Alert -- No --> Review[Trend and release review]
    Incident --> Learn[Correction + test + post-incident action]
    Review --> Learn
    Learn --> Services

